            "action_name": {
              "value": "Poison Gasp"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The tatzlwyrm belches a puff of poisonous vapor into the face of an adjacent creature, which must attempt a 15 Fortitude save; the creature takes a \u20132 circumstance penalty to this save if it's grabbed or flat-footed. The tatzlwyrm can't use Poison Gasp again for 2 rounds.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target is sickened 1.\n- **Failure:** The target takes 2d6 poison damage and is enfeebled 1 for 1 round.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target takes 4d6 poison damage and is enfeebled 1 for 1 minute."
            },
